 creations with the community through the Steam Workshop.</p>", "short_description": "Black One Blood Brothers is a tactical military shooter game where strategy and coordination are key. Command a squad of top operators, with unique skills, through high-risk missions around the globe. Customize your crew, plan your missions, and adjust on the fly for a vast replayability.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621560/9a4beb28e1ebe720866be671569d04e4d44650eb/header.jpg?t=1782732758", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621560/05da5ba8079f0d619cb573a18447673b9bb40f4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782732758", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621560/05da5ba8079f0d619cb573a18447673b9bb40f4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782732758", "website": "https://www.helios-studio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10, 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400, AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB), AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 45 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Hard Disk recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10, 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700K, AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphic